const prompt=`You generate candidate interpretations for the semantic intake stage of an autonomous short-video system. The input may be a person, fictional character, company, object, event, phenomenon, question, colloquial name, transliteration, or short ambiguous term. The language of the topic is independent from the selected output language. Do not choose a winner yet.

